  /// MacroSettings · a description
  /// shown through SettingsPage.description
  description "A reply and the things that go with it, in one move — “Refund on its way” writes the reply, tags the ticket and sets it Pending. Applying one puts it in the reply box; its steps run when you send." => "Ett svar och det som hör till det, i ett enda steg. ”Återbetalningen är på väg” skriver svaret, taggar ärendet och sätter det som Väntande. När du tillämpar ett hamnar det i svarsrutan; dess steg körs när du skickar.";
  /// MacroSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~16 characters
  /// shown through Menu.label
  label "Add a step" => "Lägg till steg";
  /// MacroSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~23 characters
  /// shown through ReplyBodyEditor.label
  /// beside: "Title", "Category", "Write it as an internal note", "Steps"
  label "Reply (optional)" => "Svar (valfritt)";
  /// MacroSettings · a label (a field, a list item, a menu entry) · at most ~40 characters
  /// shown through Checkbox.label
  /// beside: "Title", "Category", "Reply (optional)", "Steps"
  label "Write it as an internal note" => "Skriv det som en intern anteckning";
  /// MacroSettings · a subtitle
  /// shown through Dialog.subtitle
  subtitle "Applying it writes its reply into the box; its steps run when the reply is sent." => "När du tillämpar det skrivs dess svar i rutan; dess steg körs när svaret skickas.";
  /// MacroSettings · text on the page
  /// shown through EmptyState.body
  text "Make one for the answer that always comes with a status change or a tag." => "Skapa ett för svaret som alltid kommer med en statusändring eller en tagg.";
  /// MacroSettings · text on the page
  text "None — it only writes the reply." => "Inga, det skriver bara svaret.";
  /// MacroSettings · text on the page
  /// shown through FieldLabel.text
  text "Steps, in order" => "Steg, i ordning";
  /// MacroSettings · a title
  /// shown through SettingsSection.title
  title "Every macro" => "Alla makron";
  /// MacroSettings · a title
  /// shown through Dialog.title
  title "New macro" => "Nytt makro";

